    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "Hi!\r\n\r\nNot sure if this has brought up, but would there be any plan to support luarocks?\r\nBecause currently the blocker of using `mini.deps` fully is [neorg](https://github.com/nvim-neorg/neorg) which required to install its dependencies using luarocks.",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Hi!</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Not sure if this has brought up, but would there be any plan to support luarocks?<br>\nBecause currently the blocker of using <code class=\"notranslate\">mini.deps</code> fully is <a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-neorg/neorg\">neorg</a> which required to install its dependencies using luarocks.</p>",
    "bodyText": "Hi!\nNot sure if this has brought up, but would there be any plan to support luarocks?\nBecause currently the blocker of using mini.deps fully is neorg which required to install its dependencies using luarocks.",
